B.ol=s(["Throw trash in the bin, and keep our earth clean. \ud83c\udf31","Respect your teachers \u2014 they work hard to help you learn. \ud83d\ude4f","Help your mom and dad tidy up the house. \ud83e\uddf9","Put your toys and things away after you use them. \ud83e\uddf8","Love your friends, little brothers, and sisters. Sharing is fun! \u2764\ufe0f","Don't forget to drink water and wash your hands. \ud83d\udca7","Be honest and polite to everyone. \ud83d\ude0a","Save water and turn off the lights when not in use. \ud83d\udca1","Pack your books and bag for school tomorrow. \ud83c\udf92","Greet your parents kindly before you leave for school. \ud83c\udf3c","Eat your veggies and fruit to grow strong and healthy. \ud83e\udd66","Line up patiently and wait for your turn. \ud83d\udeb6",'Say "please", "sorry", and "thank you". \ud83e\udd1d',"Brush your teeth morning and night to keep them healthy. \ud83e\udea5","Wake up early and make your own bed. \u2600\ufe0f","Be kind to the animals and plants around you. \ud83d\udc3e","Learning a little every day beats cramming all at once. \ud83d\udcda","Making mistakes is okay \u2014 that's how we learn! \ud83c\udf1f","Help a friend who is struggling if you can. \ud83e\udd17","Resting and playing outside matters too, you know. \ud83c\udf33","Listen to your parents' and teachers' advice. \ud83d\udc9b","Keep your little sibling company and look after them \u2014 you're a great big sibling! \ud83e\udd1d","Help with chores without being asked \u2014 your parents will be proud. \ud83c\udf1f","Say thank you to your teacher today. \ud83c\udf4e","Love and help your grandparents too. \ud83d\udc75","Listen when others speak; don't interrupt. \ud83d\udc42"],t.s)
