B.ajJ=new A.he("\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f Clean Beach!","The beach is clean and the turtles can lay eggs safely. You are a sea hero! Remember: put trash in the bin, wherever you are.")
B.ajG=new A.he("\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Village Friend!","You helped grandpa, grandma, the teacher, and friends in the mountain village. Respect and helping out make a village happy. You are a Mountain Friend!")
B.ajA=new A.he("\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f An Honest City Kid!","You stayed honest at school, at the shop, and on the street. A good city starts with one honest kid \u2014 and that is you!")
