B.Nu=new A.y("Jellyfish","A jellyfish floats near the shore. Look, but do not touch.","The pretty can sometimes be dangerous \u2014 be careful.",B.M)
B.R7=new A.y("Star Sand","The sand here holds shells like tiny stars.","Small things can be beautiful \u2014 look around you today.",B.t)
B.Ok=new A.y("Lost Child","A little child looks for their mother on the beach. Let us help!","Help the lost \u2014 may you always be helped too.",B.t)
B.O3=new A.y("Whale Passes","A big whale passes in the distance. So amazing!","The big is not always scary \u2014 it is just passing by.",B.t)
B.MS=new A.y("Clean Beach","Kiko invites friends to pick up trash together. A cleaner beach!","Cleanliness is a shared job \u2014 invite your friends.",B.F)
B.QK=new A.y("Lighthouse","The lighthouse shines every night, guiding ships home safely.","Be like a lighthouse \u2014 give light to others.",B.t)
B.Ov=new A.y("Heading Home","Evening comes. The fishermen return with fish for their families.","Today's hard work makes the family happy.",B.t)
B.NZ=new A.y("Turtles Return","The baby turtle from before is big now! It returns to the beach.","What you protect will come back to say thank you.",B.t)
